   9 | Ivan Petrov |   1.77
  10 | Jade Wong   |   1.65
  12 | Lena Novak  |   1.72
  13 | Mo Reyes    |   NULL

# IN on a boolean field with NULL
active IN (TRUE, NULL)
=> 9 rows
  id | name        | active
   1 | Ann Lee     | true
